16:33:17.216 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
16:33:17.216   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
16:33:17.216   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
